# Trikaal — Seismic Intelligence Engine
### Complete Project Documentation

---

## 1. Project Overview

**Trikaal** is a research-grade seismic intelligence system for the **Kutch region, Gujarat, India** (bbox: 22–24.5°N, 68–71.5°E). It covers the full aftershock sequence of the **2001 Bhuj earthquake (Mw 7.7)** and broader seismicity from 1990 onward.

### Goal
Transition from raw earthquake catalog data → descriptive EDA → composite risk scoring → probabilistic ETAS-based forecasting.

### Tech Stack
| Library | Version | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| Python | 3.12+ | Core language |
| pandas | ≥2.1 | Data wrangling |
| numpy | ≥1.26 | Vectorized math |
| scipy | ≥1.11 | MLE optimization, KS test |
| matplotlib / seaborn | ≥3.8 / ≥0.13 | Static plots |
| requests | ≥2.31 | API fetching |
| folium | ≥0.15 | Interactive map |

